430 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 755 0 R
/E (This happend because the full set of 18 balance variables being passed to manova\(\) caused the residual matrix to become rank-deficient, meaning some variables are linearly dependent on others \(likely because of the coding of several partisanship variables like opposition\). )
/Pg 40 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
